<title>USA: Global TeleMedia Q1 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Global TeleMedia Q1 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	  1996</p>
<p> TOTAL REVENUES:			     $1,609,006    $339,765</p>
<p> NET LOSS				     (2,278,030)   (672,100)</p>
<p> NET LOSS PER SHARE				 (.13)	 (.07)</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVERAGE NUMBER OF SHARES</p>
<p>  OUTSTANDING				  17,497,988  10,211,824</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997 includes a non-recurring, one-time charge of about $700,000 related to real estate closing costs and mortgage refinancing expenses.</p>
<p>The company said its increase in shares outstanding includes the conversion of notes payable, shares issued to consultants, shares issued in connection with a legal settlement, and shares issued in the exercise of warrants.</p>
<p>Full name is Global TeleMedia International Inc.</p>
